            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
              Nauji skelbimai aptinkami per kelias minutes, o analizė pateikiama per sekundes.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-zinc-50 pl-0 lg:pl-12 py-10 lg:py-0">
            <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-zinc-300 mb-6">03</p>
            <h3 class="text-2xl xl:text-3xl text-zinc-900 leading-[1.1] mb-5">Duomenimis</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
              Kiekvienas pasiūlymas įvertinamas pagal tikrus rinkos duomenis, kad pirktum protingai.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Photo collage -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-zinc-100" data-anim-stagger>
      <div class="h-72 lg:h-[480px] bg-zinc-200 overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/old-car-1.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-700" loading="lazy"/>
      </div>
      <div class="h-72 lg:h-[480px] bg-zinc-200 overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/car-girl-2.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-700" loading="lazy"/>
      </div>
      <div class="h-72 lg:h-[480px] bg-zinc-200 overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/images/old-car-4.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-[1.03] transition-transform duration-700" loading="lazy"/>
